21
00:02:03,880 --> 00:02:07,840
4 years later

22
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:08,920
Fallen Moon Village
Planet Ran Yun

23
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:09,390
If someone breathes the immortal mist on Qilian Peak,

24
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:11,270
they'll be healthy for 10 years !

25
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:11,950
Look at me,

26
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:14,230
have I ever been sick in all these years ?

27
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:13,960
Zhou Family's youngest son
Villager of Fallen Moon Village

28
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:14,910
Really ?

29
00:02:14,920 --> 00:02:16,190
How amazing !

30
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:17,310
Wang Ping,

31
00:02:17,600 --> 00:02:19,390
if only you could take a breath of that mist...

32
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:22,000
Wang Ping

33
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,030
I...

34
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:24,790
I'll have my father take me to the peak to breathe the immortal mist !

35
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:28,750
4 years ago, the heavens became angry,

36
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:30,070
and the immortal mist disappeared.

37
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:33,550
All of you listen to me,

38
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:35,000
it's better to learn martial arts together.

39
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:37,680
When we grow up, we can travel the martial world with our swords !

40
00:02:38,040 --> 00:02:39,590
Travel the martial world with our swords !

41
00:02:40,640 --> 00:02:41,030
Alright,

42
00:02:41,040 --> 00:02:42,150
come back for dinner !

43
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:42,870
Hurry up,

44
00:02:42,880 --> 00:02:43,590
stop playing !

45
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:44,230
Alright,

46
00:02:44,320 --> 00:02:45,470
We will continue today's tournament

47
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:46,750
after dinner !

48
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:47,750
Go !

49
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:48,910
Let's go !

50
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:50,630
Quick !

51
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:56,990
If someone breathes the immortal mist on Qilian Peak,

52
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,510
they'll be healthy for 10 years !

53
00:03:00,440 --> 00:03:01,430
Little Wang,

54
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:04,070
were you having a martial arts tournament

55
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,350
with my son again ?

56
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:07,230
Greetings, Uncle Zhou.

57
00:03:07,160 --> 00:03:10,080
Zhou Dahan
Villager of Fallen Moon Village

58
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:09,510
You're handsome and polite,

59
00:03:09,640 --> 00:03:11,510
you are indeed the child of a craftsman.

60
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:13,150
Let's go,

61
00:03:13,320 --> 00:03:15,070
take me to your father to have some furniture made.

62
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:20,790
Dad !

63
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:23,390
Uncle Zhou is here.

64
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:25,110
Brother Wang,

65
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:26,760
my son is getting married.

66
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:27,790
His house

67
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:29,030
is missing a set of furniture.

68
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:30,670
I'll need to trouble you, Brother Wang.

69
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:32,710
This is the deposit.

70
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:33,990
Okay,

71
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,270
come back in 3 days.

72
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:36,470
No problem !

73
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:40,270
He hunted such a big deer !

74
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:45,470
Dad...

75
00:03:46,640 --> 00:03:48,430
The medicine is very bitter...

76
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:50,590
Dad,

77
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:53,070
are there really Immortals on Qilian Peak ?

78
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:55,150
Drink it now,

79
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:57,240
the medicine must be drunk while hot.

80
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:06,120
Dad,

81
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:09,430
when can Ping'er stop drinking this medicine ?

82
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:11,910
Soon.

83
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:26,470
Liu Mei's medicine, along with my thunder Origin Soul

84
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:27,790
are slowly unraveling it.

85
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:29,470
After 4 years of gentle nurturing,

86
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,550
the resentment has mostly faded.

87
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:34,760
On the outside, he appears no different from an ordinary child

88
00:04:34,760 --> 00:04:37,110
but if the treatment is interrupted, he will revert.

89
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:40,990
It seems it will still take a long time to completely heal him.

90
00:04:43,520 --> 00:04:44,790
His past is severed,

91
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:46,190
he has no memories.

92
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:48,670
For him,

93
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:50,870
this is a new life.

94
00:04:53,520 --> 00:04:54,750
4 years...

95
00:04:55,640 --> 00:04:58,190
Fallen Moon Village is very similar to my hometown...

96
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:02,030
If back then, I had become an ordinary carpenter

97
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:03,790
as my father wished,

98
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:07,550
would my life really have been like this ?

99
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,310
Senior Sun.

100
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:20,350
Don't call me Senior.

101
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:23,190
I finally found the thing

102
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:24,870
you asked me to find.

103
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:28,520
With Celestial Ascension Fruits of the Northern Domain of Allheaven,

104
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:29,950
let alone a giant beast,

105
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:32,310
if a demon dragon swallowed it,

106
00:05:32,320 --> 00:05:34,470
it would be unconscious for 100 days.

107
00:05:35,280 --> 00:05:37,030
The 17 families of the Northern Domain

108
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:40,990
are always wherever traces of this fruit appear.

109
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:44,590
With my meager cultivation level,

110
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:48,870
this is the most I can do for you.

111
00:05:49,760 --> 00:05:52,670
You can go get the rest yourself.

112
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:54,160
Thank you

113
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:55,560
for your help.

114
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:57,550
It's just a transaction.

115
00:05:58,240 --> 00:05:59,430
After you pass away,

116
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:01,320
I will take your ashes

117
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:03,190
back to Planet Dark Moon in the Alliance Star System

118
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:06,000
and bury them in the village at the foot of Heaven Mountain.

119
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:07,110
Don't worry,

120
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:08,550
I won't forget.

121
00:06:19,520 --> 00:06:20,790
Who are you ?

122
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:22,950
I...

123
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:24,950
Ping'er,

124
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:26,510
this is Grandpa Sun.

125
00:06:30,080 --> 00:06:31,870
Greetings, Grandpa Sun.

126
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:34,590
He called me

127
00:06:34,880 --> 00:06:36,190
Grandpa ?

128
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:40,750
What a beautiful fruit !

129
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:43,790
The fruits flew away !?

130
00:06:46,520 --> 00:06:47,470
Grandpa,

131
00:06:47,760 --> 00:06:49,390
you can do magic ?

132
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:53,030
These things are not for a child like you.

133
00:06:53,320 --> 00:06:54,190
Why ?

134
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:55,430
Can they be eaten ?

135
00:06:55,440 --> 00:06:58,950
It's for the big beasts in the mountains that don't sleep.

136
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:00,110
Big beasts ?

137
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:00,830
How big ?

138
00:07:00,960 --> 00:07:02,750
Bigger than the Old Yellow Ox at the village entrance ?

139
00:07:02,880 --> 00:07:04,270
And why don't they sleep ?

140
00:07:04,280 --> 00:07:06,030
Will eating these fruits make them dream ?

141
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:08,470
Are you going to let him keep asking questions like this ?

142
00:07:06,520 --> 00:07:08,470
Grandpa, have you ever seen them dream ?

143
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:11,430
It's rare to see you at a loss like this.

144
00:07:13,880 --> 00:07:17,270
This child truly is endearing.

145
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:23,710
He has only 15 years of lifespan left.

146
00:07:25,520 --> 00:07:28,030
Now at the end of his life, he has no one to turn to.

147
00:07:29,280 --> 00:07:31,030
This is also a kind of karma for me.

148
00:07:31,960 --> 00:07:32,790
Grandpa.

149
00:07:33,960 --> 00:07:35,510
There's an empty house next door.

150
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:37,870
If you don't mind this rustic village,

151
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:39,470
then please stay.

152
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:43,190
Really !?

153
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:45,390
Ping'er likes Grandpa Sun !

154
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:47,190
Grandpa Sun, please stay !

155
00:07:47,200 --> 00:07:49,190
Please stay, Grandpa Sun.

156
00:07:49,200 --> 00:07:53,190
I never imagined that I, Sun Tai, after my life of wandering,

157
00:07:53,640 --> 00:07:56,590
would still find a place to settle down.

158
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,550
Awesome !

159
00:07:58,760 --> 00:08:00,110
Grandpa Sun is staying !

160
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:02,150
Grandpa,

161
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:02,870
hurry up !

162
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:04,830
Tell me a story about the big beasts !

163
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:07,670
Alright.

164
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:13,560
5 years later

165
00:08:15,960 --> 00:08:17,390
Little rascal,

166
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:19,550
why don't you spend some time with your father

167
00:08:19,560 --> 00:08:22,030
instead of coming over to see me ?

168
00:08:22,880 --> 00:08:24,150
I'm not going back.

169
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:25,990
Aunt Zhang has come again.

170
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:28,110
Here to play matchmaker again ?

171
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:29,840
You don't have to worry.

172
00:08:30,280 --> 00:08:31,950
Look, Grandpa Sun,

173
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:33,310
in the past 3 years,

174
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:35,590
Aunt Zhang has come exactly 12 times.

175
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:37,710
Why do all the aunts of the village

176
00:08:37,880 --> 00:08:39,630
want a bite of my father

177
00:08:39,640 --> 00:08:41,230
as if he were a piece of sweet cake ?

178
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:46,270
Brother Wang, look at this !

179
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:48,550
These stitchings, the thoughtfulness...

180
00:08:48,880 --> 00:08:51,430
The Zhao Family's daughter stayed up several nights for this.

181
00:08:52,280 --> 00:08:53,390
She said that

182
00:08:53,400 --> 00:08:56,750
once married, she would treat Ping'er as her own child !

183
00:08:58,640 --> 00:09:00,190
Even if you don't think of yourself,

184
00:09:00,280 --> 00:09:02,110
you need to think of your child !

185
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:04,710
He can't continue without a mother's love forever.

186
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:06,870
I have no such intention for now.

187
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:10,110
Oh, my good brother,

188
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:11,190
listen to me,

189
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:14,070
it's been 9 years since you brought Ping'er to our village.

190
00:09:14,640 --> 00:09:18,190
Back then I was still a young unmarried girl

191
00:09:18,640 --> 00:09:21,550
and now my own child is running all over the village !

192
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:22,950
A house without a woman in it

193
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:24,510
doesn't feel like a home !

194
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:25,670
Am I right,

195
00:09:25,680 --> 00:09:27,070
Brother Wang ?

196
00:09:27,560 --> 00:09:28,270
Father,

197
00:09:28,280 --> 00:09:29,350
I'm starving.

198
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,390
The child is hungry,

199
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:34,750
let's stop this matter here.

200
00:09:35,680 --> 00:09:36,350
Fine.

201
00:09:36,640 --> 00:09:38,200
I guess I wasted my time.

202
00:09:38,880 --> 00:09:40,070
Brother Wang,

203
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:41,750
if you ever change your mind,

204
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:44,590
make sure you come to me first !

205
00:09:45,880 --> 00:09:47,750
This little Ping'er truly has

206
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:51,390
quite a temper growing up.

207
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,830
He got that from his father.

208
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:55,910
He is among the gentlest in our village !

209
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:56,870
Otherwise,

210
00:09:56,880 --> 00:09:59,150
why would so many young ladies come to visit him ?

211
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:05,870
Dad,

212
00:10:06,680 --> 00:10:07,590
you...

213
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:10,590
Don't overthink it,

214
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:12,350
Aunt Zhang is just being kind.

215
00:10:12,560 --> 00:10:15,150
Since Er Hu's got a stepmother,

216
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:16,590
he doesn't get enough to eat

217
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:18,190
and gets scolded all the time.

218
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:22,560
Take your medicine first.

219
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,190
Ping'er will stay with you,

220
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:29,350
you won't be lonely.

221
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:30,550
When Ping'er grows up,

222
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:32,070
I'll take care of you into your old age

223
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:33,150
and let you enjoy a good life !

224
00:10:39,880 --> 00:10:40,630
Grandpa Sun,

225
00:10:41,040 --> 00:10:43,030
I ran much faster today than yesterday, didn't I ?

226
00:10:43,560 --> 00:10:44,230
Of course.

227
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:48,590
Don't you plan to let this child cultivate the Dao ?

228
00:10:49,120 --> 00:10:50,710
With your cultivation level,

229
00:10:50,880 --> 00:10:53,910
he's sure to have a smooth path

230
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:56,990
and will have an advantage over even the best cultivation families.

231
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,430
I named him Ping

232
00:10:58,440 --> 00:11:01,270
because I wish for him to live an ordinary, peaceful life.

233
00:11:02,280 --> 00:11:03,630
I will not let him cultivate the Dao.

234
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:06,390
In his lifetime, I will never let him experience

235
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:09,190
the cruelty and the dangers of the cultivation world.

236
00:11:10,640 --> 00:11:13,550
But this child was born very talented...

237
00:11:13,560 --> 00:11:14,870
I will not let him cultivate.

238
00:11:15,280 --> 00:11:16,150
Never.

239
00:11:17,880 --> 00:11:18,630
Don't ever

240
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:19,990
mention this again.

241
00:11:22,840 --> 00:11:24,710
Why exactly ?

242
00:11:25,520 --> 00:11:28,630
It seems like he is hiding something...

243
00:11:28,640 --> 00:11:29,230
Dad,

244
00:11:29,240 --> 00:11:30,070
Grandpa Sun,

245
00:11:31,280 --> 00:11:32,670
what are you talking about ?

246
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:33,510
Ping'er,

247
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:35,270
it's time to take your medicine.

248
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:40,510
But a mortal's lifetime will go by quickly...

249
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:45,750
A short lifespan of only a few dozen years...

250
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:49,480
Grandpa Sun,

251
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:51,270
what did you want to show me today ?

252
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:55,430
Today,

253
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:57,510
I will let you witness

254
00:11:57,520 --> 00:12:00,870
the secret art of my sect that roams the sea of stars.

255
00:12:01,880 --> 00:12:02,830
Grandpa Sun,

256
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:04,390
are you an Immortal !?

257
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:07,470
This old man started cultivating at 7

258
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:10,350
and was revered as the Head Elder for centuries.

259
00:12:10,720 --> 00:12:13,830
Today, I pass on to you our sect's secret technique...

260
00:12:14,160 --> 00:12:15,510
the Pulse Fixing Art !

261
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:20,590
This is a Corpse Puppet.

262
00:12:21,080 --> 00:12:22,430
A Corpse Puppet ?

263
00:12:22,520 --> 00:12:23,630
What is that ?

264
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:27,430
It's an avatar that can fight thousands of enemies for you.

265
00:12:31,160 --> 00:12:34,270
This big guy is a bit scary.

266
00:12:39,160 --> 00:12:40,670
A cultivator

267
00:12:41,160 --> 00:12:42,430
controls Life and Death,

268
00:12:43,160 --> 00:12:44,720
and defies the will of the heavens.

269
00:12:45,160 --> 00:12:48,070
Your illness and lifespan

270
00:12:48,280 --> 00:12:49,990
can both be rewritten.

271
00:12:50,640 --> 00:12:51,830
If you cultivate,

272
00:12:52,280 --> 00:12:56,510
you will no longer have to suffer in this frail mortal body.

273
00:12:56,840 --> 00:12:58,310
You will be immune to heat and cold,

274
00:12:58,840 --> 00:13:00,510
and free from all sickness.

275
00:13:03,560 --> 00:13:04,390
No... no...

276
00:13:04,400 --> 00:13:05,350
I promised Dad

277
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:06,350
that I will never cultivate.

278
00:13:06,480 --> 00:13:08,870
If you and I don't speak of it,

279
00:13:08,880 --> 00:13:10,470
no one will know.

280
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:12,550
Ping'er can't lie to Dad.

281
00:13:12,880 --> 00:13:14,310
I can't make Dad sad !

282
00:13:18,800 --> 00:13:20,510
Just like your father...

283
00:13:21,080 --> 00:13:22,950
stubborn to the bones.

284
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:25,230
According to the ancient texts,

285
00:13:26,560 --> 00:13:27,190
it's said...

286
00:13:27,200 --> 00:13:27,910
After that,

287
00:13:28,280 --> 00:13:29,590
Ping'er started going to school.

288
00:13:30,920 --> 00:13:32,950
He still took his medicine on time every day.

289
00:13:35,800 --> 00:13:37,990
To dispel Ping'er's resentment,

290
00:13:38,600 --> 00:13:39,990
I no longer need to use my spells.

291
00:13:40,720 --> 00:13:42,950
It feels like a huge burden has been lifted off my shoulders.

292
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:46,790
In this mundane, ordinary life,

293
00:13:47,520 --> 00:13:48,550
my Dao Heart

294
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:50,790
has grown even more harmonious and insightful.

295
00:13:52,640 --> 00:13:53,910
The Life and Death Domain

296
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:56,310
seems to be undergoing a transformation.

297
00:13:57,920 --> 00:14:00,430
But the road ahead is still shrouded in mist.

298
00:14:01,280 --> 00:14:02,870
I can only wait quietly.

299
00:14:04,520 --> 00:14:05,670
As for Sun Tai,

300
00:14:06,280 --> 00:14:07,790
he never truly gave up.

301
00:14:08,400 --> 00:14:10,800
He's constantly finding new ways to try to lead Ping'er to cultivate.

302
00:14:12,400 --> 00:14:15,870
At birth, human nature is inherently good.

303
00:14:16,560 --> 00:14:19,230
Condense yin energy from the primordial dust

304
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:22,230
and gather the corpse's soul in the Dantian.

305
00:14:22,480 --> 00:14:25,270
This is the great path of the Corpse Puppet.

306
00:14:26,800 --> 00:14:28,550
Grandpa Sun !

307
00:14:43,640 --> 00:14:44,990
10 years of springs and autumns

308
00:14:46,160 --> 00:14:47,710
passed in the blink of an eye.

309
00:14:49,680 --> 00:14:50,870
What must come

310
00:14:51,920 --> 00:14:53,590
has finally arrived.

311
00:14:56,360 --> 00:14:57,310
Grandpa Sun !

312
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:06,070
Grandpa Sun...

313
00:15:06,760 --> 00:15:07,910
Take one more sip.

314
00:15:10,360 --> 00:15:12,510
Looking back over half a lifetime,

315
00:15:12,920 --> 00:15:15,030
the man in blue robes has grown old.

316
00:15:15,640 --> 00:15:16,910
It seems that

317
00:15:17,400 --> 00:15:19,430
life has far more

318
00:15:19,680 --> 00:15:21,670
disappointments

319
00:15:22,400 --> 00:15:24,510
than satisfactions.

320
00:15:25,800 --> 00:15:28,110
Thinking back on the journey...

321
00:15:28,760 --> 00:15:34,030
I was the son of an Elder of the main branch of the Corpse Sect,

322
00:15:33,280 --> 00:15:36,200
Sun Tai
Young

323
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:37,430
a thousand years old Soul Transformation cultivator.

324
00:15:38,240 --> 00:15:42,550
Everyone said I was favored by the heavens

325
00:15:42,880 --> 00:15:45,310
with a smooth path ahead.

326
00:15:52,080 --> 00:15:53,110
Sun Tai,

327
00:15:53,480 --> 00:15:55,270
accept your miserable fate.

328
00:15:58,400 --> 00:16:01,150
In just a hundred years,

329
00:16:01,920 --> 00:16:03,670
I became

330
00:16:05,360 --> 00:16:09,710
a mere slave in the Allheaven Star System

331
00:16:10,240 --> 00:16:12,510
spat upon by everyone.

332
00:16:18,200 --> 00:16:20,950
I was outraged,

333
00:16:21,600 --> 00:16:23,350
always wondering

334
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:28,470
which step had gone wrong

335
00:16:29,240 --> 00:16:34,110
in leading me to lose everything.

336
00:16:35,720 --> 00:16:39,230
In these last ten or so years of my life,

337
00:16:40,160 --> 00:16:42,390
I finally understood.

338
00:16:44,480 --> 00:16:46,070
I...

339
00:16:47,920 --> 00:16:51,670
among thousands of choices

340
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:57,270
simply walked toward my own fate.

341
00:16:59,280 --> 00:17:00,990
Looking back now,

342
00:17:01,480 --> 00:17:03,430
we only live once

343
00:17:03,440 --> 00:17:05,070
so you should

344
00:17:05,480 --> 00:17:09,070
sing when you gain and rest when you lose.

345
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:14,230
Sorrow and resentment are fleeting.

346
00:17:15,280 --> 00:17:16,950
Now, for me

347
00:17:17,600 --> 00:17:19,710
all joys and sorrows,

348
00:17:20,680 --> 00:17:23,350
all grudges and loves,

349
00:17:24,160 --> 00:17:27,310
Note: reference to the ancient scripture Platform Sutra

350
00:17:24,160 --> 00:17:27,310
are illusions in the Bodhi mirror.

351
00:17:27,520 --> 00:17:30,550
I dismiss them with a smile.

352
00:17:30,760 --> 00:17:31,560
Don't worry,

353
00:17:32,640 --> 00:17:33,910
I will fulfill

354
00:17:34,720 --> 00:17:35,790
my promise.

355
00:18:22,680 --> 00:18:25,480
Between Life and Death...

356
00:18:27,080 --> 00:18:31,830
It turns out the difference was so fleeting after all...

357
00:18:36,920 --> 00:18:38,430
Grandpa Sun !

358
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:59,390
Escort the coffin !

359
00:19:04,560 --> 00:19:07,110
Old Sun was all alone

360
00:19:07,640 --> 00:19:11,430
but at least he had his adopted grandson Ping'er to see him off.

361
00:19:17,920 --> 00:19:18,870
Grandpa Sun,

362
00:19:19,760 --> 00:19:21,430
my carving isn't as good as Dad's.

363
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:24,140
Sun

364
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:25,440
Tai's

365
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:25,440
Tomb

366
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:25,440
Inscribed

by

367
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:25,440
his

grandson

368
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:25,440
Wang

369
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:25,440
Ping

370
00:19:22,520 --> 00:19:23,670
Please don't be offended.

371
00:19:24,320 --> 00:19:25,150
Senior Sun,

372
00:19:26,280 --> 00:19:27,590
I have collected your ashes.

373
00:19:28,320 --> 00:19:29,110
I will not fail to do

374
00:19:29,120 --> 00:19:30,110
what I promised you.

375
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:32,870
Rest in peace.

376
00:19:37,120 --> 00:19:38,390
19 years...

377
00:19:39,120 --> 00:19:40,990
Fallen Moon Village saw one generation off

378
00:19:41,480 --> 00:19:42,910
and welcomed another.

379
00:19:44,080 --> 00:19:45,270
Of the neighbors from back then,

380
00:19:45,720 --> 00:19:47,030
30% are gone.

381
00:19:48,680 --> 00:19:50,070
A mortal's life

382
00:19:51,080 --> 00:19:52,440
is nothing more than this.

383
00:19:52,440 --> 00:19:53,550
Brother Wang,

384
00:19:54,440 --> 00:19:55,990
almost 20 years have passed in a flash.

385
00:19:56,440 --> 00:19:57,470
So fast...

386
00:19:58,400 --> 00:20:01,030
I still remember how you looked when you first brought Ping'er here.

387
00:20:01,800 --> 00:20:04,190
And now, you're leaving.

388
00:20:04,720 --> 00:20:05,390
Brother Zhou,

389
00:20:05,680 --> 00:20:07,910
thank you for all your trouble over these years.

390
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:10,790
The child has grown up,

391
00:20:11,360 --> 00:20:12,710
it's time to take him out

392
00:20:12,840 --> 00:20:13,920
to see the world.

393
00:20:16,600 --> 00:20:18,230
I suppose my second daughter

394
00:20:18,240 --> 00:20:20,030
just wasn't meant to have that fortune.

395
00:20:21,440 --> 00:20:22,430
Wang Ping,

396
00:20:22,680 --> 00:20:23,470
you...

397
00:20:23,800 --> 00:20:25,110
Will you come back ?

398
00:20:25,920 --> 00:20:26,990
I probably won't.

399
00:20:30,240 --> 00:20:32,150
I hate you, Wang Ping !

400
00:20:32,440 --> 00:20:33,320
Second sister !

401
00:20:39,440 --> 00:20:41,910
Take care !

402
00:20:41,920 --> 00:20:42,870
Brothers Wang,

403
00:20:43,200 --> 00:20:44,070
take care !

404
00:20:44,440 --> 00:20:45,150
Take care !

405
00:20:45,480 --> 00:20:46,390
Take care.

406
00:20:46,720 --> 00:20:47,630
Have a safe trip !

407
00:20:49,280 --> 00:20:50,030
Dad,

408
00:20:50,360 --> 00:20:52,030
why are women always such a hassle ?

409
00:20:52,680 --> 00:20:53,990
Especially Zhou Ruotong.

410
00:20:54,760 --> 00:20:55,870
Don't you like her ?

411
00:20:57,320 --> 00:20:58,590
I wouldn't say that.

412
00:20:59,200 --> 00:21:00,750
It's just that when she cries,

413
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:01,990
in here...

414
00:21:02,920 --> 00:21:04,270
It feels a bit uncomfortable.

415
00:21:07,200 --> 00:21:07,830
Dad,

416
00:21:07,840 --> 00:21:09,070
where are we going next ?

417
00:21:09,400 --> 00:21:10,920
First, we'll see the mountains

418
00:21:11,120 --> 00:21:13,070
and how they soar majestically,

419
00:21:13,200 --> 00:21:15,040
touching the heavens while reaching the earth.

420
00:21:15,120 --> 00:21:16,510
Like Qilian Peak ?

421
00:21:16,840 --> 00:21:17,630
No.

422
00:21:18,280 --> 00:21:20,070
We'll go see mountains higher than Qilian Peak,

423
00:21:20,680 --> 00:21:21,910
much farther away.

424
00:21:23,600 --> 00:21:30,640
Go ahead and take a look

425
00:21:26,560 --> 00:21:30,640
on the other side of the mountain.

426
00:21:27,040 --> 00:21:28,470
The cycle of Life and Death

427
00:21:28,880 --> 00:21:30,560
is like wisps of smoke and drifting clouds,

428
00:21:30,680 --> 00:21:37,040
See if the wind is blowing

429
00:21:32,880 --> 00:21:37,040
across the sea.

430
00:21:37,040 --> 00:21:43,600
A lush tree always grows

431
00:21:40,240 --> 00:21:43,600
from a tender shoot.

432
00:21:30,560 --> 00:21:31,750
gone without a trace.

433
00:21:33,080 --> 00:21:34,350
I have long learned

434
00:21:34,520 --> 00:21:35,920
the many aspects of Death.

435
00:21:37,040 --> 00:21:39,130
But I have little experience

436
00:21:39,240 --> 00:21:41,150
with the essence of Life.

437
00:21:43,800 --> 00:21:50,120
That tree shields you

438
00:21:44,800 --> 00:21:50,120
from half of the cold.

439
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:45,920
I thought the Life and Death reincarnation cycle was the ultimate reality.

440
00:21:46,120 --> 00:21:47,710
But Sun Tai's final words

441
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:49,470
made me realize

442
00:21:50,960 --> 00:21:57,200
The scent of the herbs and the smoke

443
00:21:53,040 --> 00:21:57,200
have drifted away from the stove

444
00:21:50,200 --> 00:21:54,030
that the Life and Death reincarnation cycle is merely the continuation of karma.

445
00:21:54,560 --> 00:21:56,360
Sow the cause, reap the effect.

446
00:21:57,360 --> 00:22:04,400
whose fire has warmed up

447
00:22:00,440 --> 00:22:04,400
half of your lifetime.

448
00:21:56,560 --> 00:21:58,190
Effect arises from the cause.

449
00:21:59,640 --> 00:22:03,790
The fate of all living beings is based on this.

450
00:22:04,600 --> 00:22:10,840
I watch you smile

451
00:22:06,800 --> 00:22:10,840
as you run back to me.

452
00:22:04,840 --> 00:22:06,790
And above the Life and Death Domain,

453
00:22:07,320 --> 00:22:09,710
there is still the great Dao of Karma.

454
00:22:11,080 --> 00:22:17,400
That cry, however,

455
00:22:13,320 --> 00:22:17,400
came out slowly.

456
00:22:12,040 --> 00:22:15,430
The 19 years in Fallen Moon Village were a quiet living.

457
00:22:17,520 --> 00:22:24,000
I’ve walked through this world with you

458
00:22:21,000 --> 00:22:24,000
and listened to the joys and sorrows of the mountains.

459
00:22:16,520 --> 00:22:18,000
Sun Tai's matter is over

460
00:22:18,000 --> 00:22:19,350
and karma is now clear.

461
00:22:19,920 --> 00:22:21,590
The path ahead is becoming clearer.

462
00:22:24,030 --> 00:22:31,030
As I count the falling leaves, as spring warms,

463
00:22:26,600 --> 00:22:31,040
another year has flown by.

464
00:22:23,400 --> 00:22:25,430
I took Ping'er and left Fallen Moon Village

465
00:22:26,200 --> 00:22:29,160
heading into the wider human world of mountains and seas.

466
00:22:29,360 --> 00:22:31,440
Let the mountains and rivers of heaven and earth

467
00:22:31,080 --> 00:22:37,800
If you were to travel alone through the mountains and rivers

468
00:22:34,440 --> 00:22:37,800
for half your life as if attending a banquet,

469
00:22:31,520 --> 00:22:32,870
wash his soul clean

470
00:22:33,720 --> 00:22:36,470
to reveal his true self.

471
00:22:38,080 --> 00:22:41,800
I would wait for you beneath the locust tree

472
00:22:41,960 --> 00:22:47,520
with a warm bowl of food.

473
00:23:16,560 --> 00:23:23,680
A mountain is not a mountain,

474
00:23:19,340 --> 00:23:23,680
it's a place to climb and gaze into the distance.

475
00:23:23,880 --> 00:23:30,360
The landscape is lush

476
00:23:25,760 --> 00:23:30,360
with blooming flowers.

477
00:23:30,360 --> 00:23:37,000
Water flows over the cliff

478
00:23:33,800 --> 00:23:37,000
into the sea.

479
00:23:37,760 --> 00:23:44,560
Who will the rain

480
00:23:38,760 --> 00:23:44,560
fall onto next ?

481
00:23:44,640 --> 00:23:50,800
The moon sees through

482
00:23:46,640 --> 00:23:50,800
the traveler’s weathered eyes.

483
00:23:50,920 --> 00:23:58,000
He has traveled through mountains and seas

484
00:23:53,720 --> 00:23:58,000
but longs for a moment of reunion.

485
00:23:58,400 --> 00:24:04,720
The wind blows through the window

486
00:24:00,640 --> 00:24:04,720
stirring memories of days gone by filled with laughter and joy.

487
00:24:05,080 --> 00:24:11,360
All I see are

488
00:24:07,320 --> 00:24:11,360
the joys and sorrows we've shared.

489
00:24:11,400 --> 00:24:18,680
I'll take you on a journey through the mortal world,

490
00:24:16,120 --> 00:24:18,680
as autumn fades and spring returns.

491
00:24:18,680 --> 00:24:25,320
As the snow falls from the eaves,

492
00:24:21,120 --> 00:24:25,320
I hope this letter finds you well.

493
00:24:25,720 --> 00:24:32,160
I’ll wait for you under the locust tree,

494
00:24:28,880 --> 00:24:32,160
having weathered the storms of our journey so far.

495
00:24:32,160 --> 00:24:38,880
Looking back, the smell of the food

496
00:24:34,920 --> 00:24:38,880
hasn't changed.

497
00:24:39,000 --> 00:24:42,240
Take your time.

498
00:24:42,240 --> 00:24:49,440
I’ve walked through this world with you

499
00:24:46,600 --> 00:24:49,440
and listened to the joys and sorrows of the mountains.

500
00:24:49,440 --> 00:24:56,320
As I count the falling leaves, as spring warms,

501
00:24:51,720 --> 00:24:56,320
another year has flown by.

502
00:24:56,520 --> 00:25:03,160
I’ll wait for you under the locust tree,

503
00:24:59,960 --> 00:25:03,160
having weathered the storms of our journey so far.

504
00:25:03,200 --> 00:25:10,520
Looking back, the smell of the food

505
00:25:06,800 --> 00:25:10,520
hasn't changed.

506
00:25:13,840 --> 00:25:17,160
Take your time.

507
00:25:26,600 --> 00:25:31,200
Traversing
the mortal world

508
